WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.330
Part nine: the volunteer directory. Find anyone's contact info fast, and filter by program, paperwork, or shifts.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:19.940
Tap Directory on your page. In admin view, it's also in the brown bar. Board members can be given directory access without being admins.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.948
Search by name, email, phone, student, or parent.

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:30.101
Filter by program, adults or minors, paperwork, upcoming shifts, or missing contact info.

00:00:30.301 --> 00:00:35.635
Each card shows programs, student, contact info, paperwork, and their next shift.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:39.057
Call, Text, and Email open your phone or your email.

00:00:39.257 --> 00:00:42.700
Open in admin takes you to their admin page.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.175
Paperwork missing shows who needs a follow-up,

00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:49.710
and exactly what's missing for each person.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.819
Minors only,

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:59.670
For a minor, you only see the parent or guardian's name and phone. The student's own contact info is never shown.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:10.770
Only active volunteers are listed, and every lookup is logged. That's the admin guide. Questions? Use the tech support link at the bottom of any page.
